  (lib_symbols)
  (text "READ ONLY DUMPER. Do not connect legacy/pcb-esp32.\nEdge pin numbers are seto KiCad Conn_02x20, verify by continuity.\nPin 2 VCC via 47 ohm after GND. Pin 40 VMEM via 100k/100k to Mega A0, not to 5V.\nPin 31 P31/WERAM1 via 470 ohm to GND, no GPIO.\nPin 34 P34/~WERAM2 pulled to 5V and driven HIGH only.\nA0-A14 Mega 22-36. D0-D7 Mega 37-44 inputs. 470 ohm series.\n~CEROM 46, ~OEROM 47, ~CSRAM 48, P18 49, P33 50, P34 51, P38 52.\nPins 29,32,35,36,37 unconnected on both of seto's sheets."
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top))
